.TH DUSK-STICKY-NOTES 1 "November 2026" "dusk-sticky-notes 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dusk-sticky-notes \- colored sticky notes for GNOME
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dusk-sticky-notes
[\fIOPTION\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the notes list and reopens the notes that were popped out.
If Sticky Notes is already running, the running instance handles the request.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-new\-note
Open a new note.
.TP
.B \-\-new\-from\-selection
Open a new note with the selected text.
.TP
.B \-\-restore
Reopen only the popped-out notes, as at login.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show all options, including the GApplication ones.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/dusk-sticky-notes/
The notes and their images.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/phlthydelphya/StickyNotes
